{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24246","headline":"酬皇甫郎中对新菊花见忆 · 白居易","name":"酬皇甫郎中对新菊花见忆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱菊高人吟逸韵，悲秋病客感衰怀。\n黄花助兴方携酒，红叶添愁正满堦。\n居士荤腥今已断，仙郎杯杓爲谁排。\n媿君相忆东篱下，拟废重阳一日斋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}